==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Exeggcute}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM-P Promo|Exeggcute|355}}, one of the {{TCG|SM-P Promotional cards}} released only in Japan.
*'''Rolling Tackle''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Dark Electrode|34}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

